@startuml
title FootTech — Diagramme de classes — 07 classes statistiques dashboards
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1565C0
  FontColor #263238
  ArrowColor #455A64
}
class "BilanJoueurSaison\nplayer_season_bilan" as SeasonView {
  +playerId: UUID
  +seasonId: UUID
  +matches: Integer
  +minutes: Integer
  +goals: Integer
  +assists: Integer
  +averageRating: Decimal
}
class StatisticsService {
  +personalStats()
  +teamStats()
  +comparePlayers()
  +playerEvolution()
}
class SeasonReportService {
  +buildBilan()
  +filter()
  +exportPdf()
}
class DashboardService {
  +coachDashboard()
  +playerDashboard()
  +adminDashboard()
  +pendingActivations()
}
class DashboardDTO {
  +kpis: Map
  +upcomingEvents: List
  +alerts: List
}
StatisticsService --> SeasonView
SeasonReportService --> SeasonView
DashboardService --> StatisticsService
DashboardService --> DashboardDTO
note bottom
US-43 à US-49 et US-71 à US-74.
Les agrégats sont filtrés selon l'identité, le rôle et l'équipe.
end note
@enduml
